        "id": 1000127
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-12T04:41:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The flows are referenced using logical_flow Ids on the KV store. The \"flow_category\" is additional information about the flow. Since the whole of the OpenOlt flow manager module is built around specific set of flows, I will prefer not to venture into it now. I think this should be taken up separately.",
      "parentUuid": "a5222b6b_8cfd265e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 39,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 39,
        "endChar": 9
