        "id": 1000480
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-06T16:33:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This needs to be refactored with the latest master supporting multiple resource managers for multiple technologies. This means there are multiple TechProfiles: one per resource manager. I suggest making tech profile an attribute of resource manager rather than the opposite.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 94,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 94,
